Z||000000||fiero56||06-17-2001||06:15 PM||||I gotsa' question for you?<P>I'm woking on a new color scheme for my Formul, and I've gone through all of your old pic posts for the door emblems, and haven't seen the color I'm after. I am looking for a navy blue(<B>dark</B> blue) color for my door emblems and  cigarette lighter(very similar to door emblems in ease to paint and style).<P>I don't know the exact shade I will need yet, as I haven't received the leather for my steering wheel(want to match the leather), but wondering if you work with dark blue? I could hit a local yard, and "purchase <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">" a handful of door emblems for ya', or pay you, or both.<P>Figured I would post this here in case others might be interested in the dark blue color.<BR>||||reg||10
Z||000001||Oreif||06-17-2001||11:10 PM||||I have 6 different blue's that I have done.<BR>Baby Blue<BR>Medium Blue<BR>Cobolt Blue<BR>Metallic Cobolt Blue<BR>Dark Blue <BR>and Navy Blue.<P>The Navy Blue is the darkest Blue. But I can do just about any color including metallics. I recently did one that looks like the GT style except the red crest was dark blue. Looks cool for the dark blue GT it was going in. <BR>Once you get the blue shade you want either scan the color or if you can get a small sample of the leather, I can match it.<P>------------------<BR>      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/LOGO3.jpg">    <BR><B><I>Got Emblems?</I></B>||||reg||1
